### E-commerce OMS — full happy path (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### Run against a fresh `./mvnw spring-boot:run` (H2 + seed). Requests reuse tokens captured from the login responses.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Log in as the demo customer
# @name loginAlice
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "alice@oms.test", "password": "Customer@123"}

> {% client.global.set("alice", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Log in as BLR staff
# @name loginBlr
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "staff.blr@oms.test", "password": "Staff@123"}

> {% client.global.set("staffBlr", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Log in as MUM staff
# @name loginMum
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "staff.mum@oms.test", "password": "Staff@123"}

> {% client.global.set("staffMum", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Log in as admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@oms.test", "password": "Admin@123"}

> {% client.global.set("admin", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 2. Browse the catalog (public)
GET {{base}}/categories

###
GET {{base}}/products?q=galaxy

###
GET {{base}}/products/5

### 3. Cart: 1 x Galaxy S24 (BLR/DEL) and 1 x MacBook Air (MUM only): no single warehouse covers both
POST {{base}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 2, "quantity": 1}

###
POST {{base}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 5, "quantity": 1}

### Quote with a coupon (no order placed)
POST {{base}}/cart/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"couponCode": "WELCOME10"}

### 4. Checkout (idempotent). Send twice: 201 then 200 with the same order.
# @name checkout
POST {{base}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-0001-abcdef
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "couponCode": "WELCOME10",
  "shippingAddress": {"name": "Alice", "line1": "1 MG Road", "city": "Bengaluru", "state": "KA", "pincode": "560001", "phone": "9876543210"}
}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### The order: CONFIRMED with two shipments once the async routing has run
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### 5. BLR packs, ships and delivers its shipment
GET {{base}}/warehouse/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{staffBlr}}

###
PATCH {{base}}/warehouse/shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffBlr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "PACKED"}

###
PATCH {{base}}/warehouse/shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffBlr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "SHIPPED", "trackingNumber": "TRK-BLR-1"}

###
PATCH {{base}}/warehouse/shipments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffBlr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "DELIVERED"}

### MUM does the same for shipment 2
PATCH {{base}}/warehouse/shipments/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffMum}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "PACKED"}

###
PATCH {{base}}/warehouse/shipments/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffMum}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "SHIPPED", "trackingNumber": "TRK-MUM-1"}

###
PATCH {{base}}/warehouse/shipments/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffMum}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "DELIVERED"}

### The order is now DELIVERED
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### 6. Return the Galaxy: request -> approve -> receive (restock) -> pro-rata refund
# @name createReturn
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Screen scratched", "items": [{"orderItemId": 1, "quantity": 1}]}

> {% client.global.set("returnId", response.body.id); client.global.set("returnItemId", response.body.items[0].id); %}

###
POST {{base}}/warehouse/returns/{{returnId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffBlr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note": "ok"}

###
POST {{base}}/warehouse/returns/{{returnId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{staffBlr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"returnItemId": {{returnItemId}}, "restock": true}]}

### PARTIALLY_RETURNED with a RETURN refund
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### 7. Admin views
GET {{base}}/admin/inventory?productId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
GET {{base}}/admin/inventory/movements?productId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
GET {{base}}/admin/audit-logs?entityType=ORDER&entityId={{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
GET {{base}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### Errors worth seeing: a quote on the (now empty) cart -> 422 CART_EMPTY
POST {{base}}/cart/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
POST {{base}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shippingAddress": {"name": "Alice", "line1": "1 MG Road", "city": "Bengaluru", "state": "KA", "pincode": "560001", "phone": "9876543210"}}

###
GET {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{staffBlr}}
